[22.25, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.8, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m The SSD needs a volume, a shared folder, then a careful data migration\r\n"]
[23.7, "o", "  that preserves ownership — Postgres and Mongo data live on those shares.\r\n"]
[24.8, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.35, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mCalling claude-in-chrome 1 time…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.05, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Inspecting…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(22s · ↓ 1.4k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.05, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.6, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m The QTS session has expired — the NAS rebooted during the swap, and\r\n"]
[29.5, "o", "  it's now at the login prompt asking for the admin password.\r\n"]
[30.7, "o", "\r\n"]
[31.25, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mI can't type a password into a login form. That's a hard limit.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.15, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mSign in at https://nas.example.com and tell me when you're in.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.75, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[35.95, "o", "\r\n"]
[36.5, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── nas-nfs-recommendation\u001b[0m\r\n"]
